Waste Stabilisation Ponds — von Sperling (@wu-bw3: 0, is #reference, #part-of @wu-sources) { r_6KF1B0Z7Q1RDRX1S4DSDJA1D7J
Marcos von Sperling. Biological Wastewater Treatment Series, volume 3, IWA Publishing, 2007. [Persistent publisher reference](https://doi.org/10.2166/9781780402109).

Read the complete pond treatment account, including configuration, loading, hydraulic behaviour and operating interpretation. Follow the differences among anaerobic, facultative and maturation functions, then compare model assumptions with climate, depth, mixing and measured effluent.

The title and edition belong to the publisher's open-access series. Use the actual volume's notices and current environmental requirements; do not infer that a nominal retention time or historical design range proves treatment for a new site.

